{"ticker":"ABT","updated":"2026-11-13T22:33:14Z","profile":{"longName":"Abbott Laboratories","shortName":"Abbott Laboratories","sector":"Healthcare","industry":"Medical Devices","country":"United States","website":"https://www.abbott.com","fullTimeEmployees":122000,"marketCap":187950301184,"trailingPE":40.492535,"forwardPE":18.278683,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":3.8970392,"pegRatio":1.58,"targetMeanPrice":118.90731,"targetHighPrice":130.0,"targetLowPrice":100.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":26,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.145,"earningsGrowth":-0.436,"grossMargins":0.57171,"operatingMargins":0.15648,"profitMargins":0.09747,"totalRevenue":48228999168,"beta":0.537,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":132.03,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":81.97,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":2.35},"summary":"Abbott Laboratories, together with its subsidiaries, discovers, develops, manufactures, and sells health care products worldwide. It operates in four segments: Established Pharmaceutical Products, Diagnostic Products, Nutritional Products, and Medical Devices. The company offers generic pharmaceuticals for the treatment of pancreatic exocrine insufficiency, irritable bowel syndrome or biliary spasm, intrahepatic cholestasis or depressive symptoms, gynecological disorder, hormone replacement therapy, dyslipidemia, hypertension, hypothyroidism, hypertriglyceridemia, Ménière's disease and vestibular vertigo, pain, fever, inflammation, and migraine, as well as provides anti-infective clarithromycin, influenza vaccine, and products to regulate physiological rhythm of the colon. It also provides laboratory and transfusion medicine systems in the areas of immunoassay, clinical chemistry, hematology, and transfusion serology testing; molecular diagnostics polymerase chain reaction instrument systems that automate the extraction, purification, and preparation of DNA and RNA from patient samples, and detect and measure infectious agents; point of care systems; cartridges for testing blood gas, chemistry, electrolytes, coagulation, and immunoassay; rapid diagnostics lateral flow testing products; molecular point-of-care testing for HIV, SARS-CoV-2, influenza A and B, RSV, and strep A; car","summary_zh":"雅培實驗室及其子公司在全球範圍內發現、開發、製造和銷售醫療保健產品。它的業務分為四個部門：成熟的藥品部門、診斷產品部門、營養產品部門和醫療器材部門。該公司提供治療胰臟外分泌功能不全、腸躁症或膽道痙攣、肝內膽汁淤積或憂鬱症狀、婦科疾病、荷爾蒙替代療法、血脂異常、高血壓、甲狀腺功能減退症、高三酸甘油酯血症、梅尼爾氏症和前庭眩暈、疼痛、發燒、發炎和偏頭痛的仿製藥，並提供抗感染藥物克拉黴素、流感和結腸疫苗的調節。它還提供免疫分析、臨床化學、血液學和輸血血清學檢測領域的實驗室和輸血醫學系統；分子診斷聚合酶鏈反應儀器系統，可自動從患者樣本中提取、純化和製備 DNA 和 RNA，並檢測和測量傳染源；護理點系統；用於測試血氣、化學、電解質、凝血和免疫測定的試劑盒快速診斷 HIVV-ASARS、SARS、SARS、ASARS、SARS、SARS、ASARS、SARS、SARS、SARS、SARS、SARS、SARS、SARS、SARS、SARS、SARS、SARS、SARS、SARS、SARS、SARS、SARS、SARS、SARS、SARS、SARS、SARS、SARS、SARS、SARS、SARS、SARS、SARS、SARS型、SARS、SARS、SARS；型鏈球菌的分子護理點檢測；車","sector_zh":"衛生保健","industry_zh":"醫療器材","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-15","o":133.88,"h":134.35,"l":130.96,"c":131.33,"v":4057700},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":131.76,"h":133.66,"l":131.2,"c":132.76,"v":5401600},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":132.71,"h":134.22,"l":132.71,"c":134.17,"v":5113300},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":134.09,"h":134.78,"l":132.1,"c":134.57,"v":5891700},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":134.7,"h":136.73,"l":133.72,"c":136.04,"v":11547400},{"t":"2025-09-22","o":135.33,"h":137.49,"l":134.95,"c":136.62,"v":4837000},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":136.28,"h":136.88,"l":135.04,"c":135.89,"v":5136400},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":135.31,"h":136.83,"l":133.79,"c":133.89,"v":3932400},{"t":"2025-09-25","o":134.43,"h":134.43,"l":131.18,"c":133.31,"v":4963400},{"t":"2025-09-26","o":133.98,"h":134.2,"l":133.1,"c":133.55,"v":4182100},{"t":"2025-09-29","o":133.0,"h":133.5,"l":131.71,"c":133.11,"v":4351900},{"t":"2025-09-30","o":132.86,"h":134.5,"l":132.18,"c":133.94,"v":7538300},{"t":"2025-10-01","o":134.8,"h":135.45,"l":129.08,"c":133.47,"v":10613900},{"t":"2025-10-02","o":132.42,"h":133.39,"l":130.51,"c":132.99,"v":5916700},{"t":"2025-10-03","o":133.25,"h":135.37,"l":132.79,"c":134.59,"v":5362200},{"t":"2025-10-06","o":134.32,"h":135.24,"l":133